Hello, I would like a simple till for my shop counter, please.

My prices are: coffee beans cost $12.50, a mug costs $8, and filter papers cost $3.20.

Please keep asking me which item I want and how many of them, until I type "done".

If I type something that isn't one of those items, please tell me it isn't on the list and ask me again.

When I type "done", please show me the total. If the total is over $50, please take 10% off and show me the discounted total as well.

Thank you!
